The AzCopy container image that src/azcopy-job/Dockerfile builds downloads
AzCopy from https://github.com/Azure/azure-storage-azcopy and uses the
ubuntu:26.04 base image. Those components are not part of this repository and
are distributed under their own licenses.

The Terraform configuration in deploy/terraform downloads HashiCorp Terraform
providers from the Terraform Registry at initialization. Those providers are
distributed under their own licenses.
